1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:02,466
Dette er tingen ingen snakker om

2
00:00:02,466 --> 00:00:03,720
før vinterturen.

3
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:05,811
Jeg var litt skeptisk for å være

4
00:00:05,811 --> 00:00:07,837
ærlig, men jeg tok på meg disse

5
00:00:07,837 --> 00:00:09,239
før turen i morges.

6
00:00:09,239 --> 00:00:11,514
Vått, gjørmete, snø overalt.

7
00:00:11,514 --> 00:00:14,195
Etterpå: helt tørre sokker, ingen

8
00:00:14,195 --> 00:00:16,227
snø i skoene, ingen grus,

9
00:00:16,227 --> 00:00:17,100
ingenting.

10
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,699
De satt på hele veien.

11
00:00:18,699 --> 00:00:20,358
Ikke noe styr, ingenting som gled

12
00:00:20,358 --> 00:00:20,639
ned.

13
00:00:20,639 --> 00:00:22,159
Nå tar jeg dem med hver gang.

14
00:00:22,159 --> 00:00:24,653
Skogen, hundeturen, vandringen,

15
00:00:24,653 --> 00:00:25,760
sammenhengen.

16
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,747
En enkel ting, men den fungerer

17
00:00:27,747 --> 00:00:28,860
faktisk.
